WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.200
Are you excited?

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Hi! I'm Emelyn.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.800
I'd love to be part of your pup's care team.

4
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.000
And maybe save your next pair of slippers.

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.600
It all started with my huskies, Kira and Kiko.

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.400
Huskies are made to run. Some days a walk just wasn't enough.

7
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.600
Too hot. Too smoky. Or I was just wiped out after work.

8
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.400
So I built a gym on wheels.

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.100
I pull up right to your curb.

10
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.600
Straight in. No hesitation.

11
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.100
Climate-controlled. Lots of windows. Plenty of room.

12
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.100
30 minutes, one-on-one. I'm right by their side.

13
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.100
No motor. The belt only moves when your dog does.

14
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.400
Praise, toys and treats.

15
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:50.000
Will my dog actually get on it?

16
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.000
I want to show how the slat mills are a tool to be able to train all kinds of dogs.

17
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.800
Little dogs, big dogs, old dogs.

18
00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.300
And how even when it's not the right fit, it's still an enrichment activity.

19
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:04.100
Delilah's first time: she started moving.

20
00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.900
Happy tail wags!

21
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.900
Not every dog steps right on. We go slow.

22
00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:14.300
After a good run...

23
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.300
Come on, Kymber!

24
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:18.100
Plus a photo update after every session.

25
00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:21.600
Not instead of your walks. The run a walk can't always give.

26
00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.600
For dogs who love to run, seniors and shy pups.

27
00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:32.600
Request my pup's first session. Tap the button under this video. Takes about a minute.

